{"path":"experimental/basic_string_view/copy","title":"std::experimental::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::copy","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>copy","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/basic_string_view/copy","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Copies the substring [pos, pos + rcount) to the character string pointed to by dest, where rcount is the smaller of count and size() - pos.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type copy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> dest,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; size_type count,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; size_type pos <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Copies the substring <code>[pos, pos + rcount)</code> to the character string pointed to by <code>dest</code>, where <code>rcount</code> is the smaller of <code>count</code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> pos</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  dest\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  pointer to the destination character string\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  position of the first character\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  count\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  requested substring length\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Number of characters copied\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\">std::out_of_range</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in <code>rcount</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/basic_string_view/substr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>substr</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a substring <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/basic_string_view","title":"std::experimental::basic_string_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::copy","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Copies the substring [pos, pos + rcount) to the character string pointed to by dest, where rcount is the smaller of…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"dest, pos, count"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Number of characters copied"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"std::out_of_range if pos > size()."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Linear in rcount."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"substr","note":"returns a substring"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":86,"codeBlockCount":0}
